title : |md
    # Conexiones General
|{near:top-center}

EEPROM I2C <-> FPGA
EEPROM I2C.shape : rectangle
EEPROM I2C : |`md
    ### EEPROM I2C
    |Señal|Pin|_|
    |-|-|-|
    |SCL(Pull Up) | 24 |<-| 
    |SDA(Pull Up) | 23 |<->|
`|

LCD MIPI.shape:rectangle
LCD MIPI <- FPGA
LCD MIPI :|`md
    ### LDC MIPI

    |Señal|Pin|Pin LVDS|
    |-|-|-|    
    |CLK_N| 128 |112|
    |CLK_P| 126 |113|
    |DATA 1_N| 125 |114|
    |DATA 1_P| 124 |115|
    |DATA 0_N| 123 |116|
    |DATA 0_P| 122 |117|                     
`|{near:center-right}

MCU CH32V -> FPGA
USB -> MCU CH32V

Cartucho : {
    near:bottom-left
    Dirección_0 <- _.FPGA
    Dirección_0 : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | A0    | 64 |
        | A1    | 65 |
        | A2    | 66 |
        | A3    | 67 |
        | A4    | 68 |
        | A5    | 69 |
        | A6    | 70 |        
    `|
    Dirección_1 <- _.FPGA
    Dirección_1 : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | A7    | 71 |
        | A8    | 72 |
        | A9    | 76 |
        | A10   | 78 |
        | A11   | 79 |
        | A12   | 80 |
        | A13   | 82 |
        | A14   | 83 |
        | A15   | 84 |
