    Control <- _.FPGA
    Control : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | CLK   | 60 |
        | N_WR  | 61 |
        | N_RD  | 62 |
        | N_CS  | 63 |
    `|
}

BufferData <-> Cartucho.Datos
FPGA <-> BufferData
BufferData.shape : rectangle
BufferData : |`md
    ### Buffer
    |Señal|Pin|
    |-|-|
    |#OE|  |
    |DIR|  |
`|


Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up) -> FPGA
Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up).shape : rectangle
Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up): |`md

    ### Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up)

    |Señal|Pin|
    |-|-|
    |A| 51 |
    |B | 50 |
    |START| 97 |
    |SELECT| 98 |
    |RIGHT| 99 |
    |UP| 101 |
    |DOWN| 100 |
    |LEFT_| 102 |
    
`|

Flash SPI.shape : rectangle
Flash SPI <-> FPGA
Flash SPI : |`md
    ### Flash SPI
    |Señal|Pin|_|
    |-|-|-|
    |CLK | 93 |<-|
    |N_CS(Pull-up)| 94 |<-|
    |MOSI(Pull-up)| 95 |<-|
    |MISO(Pull-up)| 96 |->|
`|

GB Link.shape : rectangle
GB Link <-> FPGA
